<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Cat Breeds & Prices</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    background: #fdf6ec;
    color: #333;
  }
  header {
    background: #ff9f68;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 60px 20px;
  }
  header h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  header p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  .container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 40px auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 25px;
  }
  .card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .card img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 180px;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .card-content {
    padding: 15px;
  }
  .card-content h3 {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: #ff7f42;
  }
  .card-content p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .price {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #333;
  }
  footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px;
    margin-top: 40px;
    color: #999;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>Cat Breeds & Prices</h1>
  <p>Find your perfect feline companion and see what they typically cost.</p>
</header>

<div class="container">
  <div class="grid">

    <div class="card">
      <img src="https://placekitten.com/400/300" alt="Persian cat">
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>Persian</h3>
        <p>Long-haired and calm, known for their sweet flat faces.</p>
        <p class="price">$800 - $2,500</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <img src="https://placekitten.com/401/300" alt="Maine Coon cat">
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>Maine Coon</h3>
        <p>One of the largest breeds, friendly and dog-like in nature.</p>
        <p class="price">$1,000 - $3,000</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <img src="https://placekitten.com/402/300" alt="Siamese cat">
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>Siamese</h3>
        <p>Vocal and social, with striking blue eyes and short coats.</p>
        <p class="price">$400 - $1,200</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <img src="https://placekitten.com/403/300" alt="Bengal cat">
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>Bengal</h3>
        <p>Wild-looking spotted coat with a playful, energetic personality.</p>
        <p class="price">$1,500 - $5,000</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <img src="https://placekitten.com/404/300" alt="British Shorthair cat">
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>British Shorthair</h3>
        <p>Round-faced and easygoing, with a dense plush coat.</p>
        <p class="price">$1,000 - $2,000</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <img src="https://placekitten.com/405/300" alt="Ragdoll cat">
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>Ragdoll</h3>
        <p>Gentle giants that go limp with relaxation when held.</p>
        <p class="price">$800 - $2,000</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<footer>
  <p>&copy; 2026 Cat Breeds & Prices. All prices are estimates.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
